## Hypothesis checklist (`t2Space_ghGlue`)

| paper hypothesis | here |
|---|---|
| `𝔼_{≥0}`-manifolds | ⚠ `𝔼₀` only (T-btz-scope) |
| `i`, `j` BTZ-extensions | ✓ carried: `IsBTZEmbedding i`, `IsBTZEmbedding j` |
