| (none) | ⚠ strengthened: `M₁` connected (`E0AbsMax.e0_sfa_of_globalBTZ`, as in `GX.Pgcd`) |

## SCOPE (disclosed)

* **Readings.** The gluing is `Causal.Gluing` (the quotient by the equivalence generated by `∼`,
